</td><td>256 GB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Weight</td><td>1.2 kg</td><td>2.1 kg</td><td class=\"best\">1.0 kg</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Battery</td><td>18 h</td><td>9 h</td><td class=\"best\">22 h</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Ports</td><td>2x USB-C, HDMI, headphone</td><td class=\"best\">2x USB-C, 3x USB-A, HDMI, Ethernet, SD card</td><td>2x USB-C, headphone</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Rating</td><td class=\"best\">4.6 / 5</td><td>4.4 / 5</td><td>4.2 / 5</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Price per GB storage</td><td>$2.54</td><td class=\"best\">$1.85</td><td>$3.90</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Battery life (hours)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":9},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":22}]}'></div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Price (USD)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1299},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":1899},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":999}]}'></div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Weight (kg)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1.2},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":2.1},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":1}]}'></div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Customer reviews (count)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1840},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":960},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":2310}]}'></div></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n<div class=\"card stack\"><h3 class=\"h4\">Aero 14</h3>\n<div><span class=\"up small\">Pros</span><ul class=\"plain\"><li>Gorgeous OLED panel</li><li>Great battery</li><li>Quiet under load</li></ul></div>\n<div><span class=\"down small\">Cons</span><ul class=\"plain\"><li>Soldered RAM</li><li>Glossy screen</li></ul></div></div>\n<div class=\"card stack\"><h3 class=\"h4\">Forge 16</h3>\n<div><span class=\"up small\">Pros</span><ul class=\"plain\"